{"id":"a463cba20093b520","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-covariance.md","title":"Covariance","display":"df-covariance — Covariance","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-covariance","aliases":["58-df-covariance","Covariance"],"display":"df-covariance — Covariance","depends_on":["[[58-df-probability-space]]","[[58-df-expectation]]","[[58-df-measurable-function]]","[[58-df-integral]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-covariance"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-covariance</span><span>Covariance</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-covariance — Covariance"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"58-df-probability-space\">58-df-probability-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2e4ee9615831113b\" href=\"?note=2e4ee9615831113b\" title=\"58-df-expectation\">58-df-expectation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"58-df-measurable-function\">58-df-measurable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4884f45058a56aac\" href=\"?note=4884f45058a56aac\" title=\"58-df-integral\">58-df-integral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,h,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,c,v,r\\in V\">\\(X,Y,h,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,c,v,r\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SquareIntegrableReal}_S(X;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\">\\(\\mathrm{SquareIntegrableReal}_S(X;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\)</span> (square-integrable representative predicate defined here).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S\\)</span> (real-valued measurable-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"58-df-measurable-function\">58-df-measurable-function</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Covariance}_S(c,X,Y;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Covariance}_S(c,X,Y;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Variance}_S(v,X;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Variance}_S(v,X;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Correlation}_S(r,X,Y;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Correlation}_S(r,X,Y;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\)</span> (value predicates defined here).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExpectedValue}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{ExpectedValue}_S\\)</span> (expectation-value predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2e4ee9615831113b\" href=\"?note=2e4ee9615831113b\" title=\"58-df-expectation\">58-df-expectation</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}square\\text{-}integrable\\text{-}real} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{SquareIntegrableReal}_S(X;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}_S(\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\land\n\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(X;\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\land\n\\int_\\Omega |X|^2\\,d\\mathbb P&lt;\\infty\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}square\\text{-}integrable\\text{-}real} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{SquareIntegrableReal}_S(X;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}_S(\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\land\n\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(X;\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\land\n\\int_\\Omega |X|^2\\,d\\mathbb P&lt;\\infty\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}covariance} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Covariance}_S(c,X,Y;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SquareIntegrableReal}_S(X;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\mathrm{SquareIntegrableReal}_S(Y;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\exists e_X,e_Y,h\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{ExpectedValue}_S(e_X,X;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\operatorname{ExpectedValue}_S(e_Y,Y;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(h,\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\land\n\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega\\;(h(\\omega)=(X(\\omega)-e_X)(Y(\\omega)-e_Y))\\land\n\\operatorname{ExpectedValue}_S(c,h;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}covariance} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Covariance}_S(c,X,Y;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SquareIntegrableReal}_S(X;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\mathrm{SquareIntegrableReal}_S(Y;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\exists e_X,e_Y,h\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{ExpectedValue}_S(e_X,X;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\operatorname{ExpectedValue}_S(e_Y,Y;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(h,\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\land\n\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega\\;(h(\\omega)=(X(\\omega)-e_X)(Y(\\omega)-e_Y))\\land\n\\operatorname{ExpectedValue}_S(c,h;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}variance} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Variance}_S(v,X;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Covariance}_S(v,X,X;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}variance} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Variance}_S(v,X;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Covariance}_S(v,X,X;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}correlation} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Correlation}_S(r,X,Y;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists c,v_X,v_Y\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Covariance}_S(c,X,Y;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\mathrm{Variance}_S(v_X,X;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\mathrm{Variance}_S(v_Y,Y;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\nv_X&gt;0\\land v_Y&gt;0\\land r=\\frac{c}{\\sqrt{v_Xv_Y}}\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}correlation} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Correlation}_S(r,X,Y;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists c,v_X,v_Y\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Covariance}_S(c,X,Y;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\mathrm{Variance}_S(v_X,X;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\mathrm{Variance}_S(v_Y,Y;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\nv_X&gt;0\\land v_Y&gt;0\\land r=\\frac{c}{\\sqrt{v_Xv_Y}}\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every value predicate carries the probability space explicitly; no hidden ambient measure or quotient-class evaluation remains.</li>\n<li>Independence: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cov}(X, Y) = 0\">\\(\\mathrm{Cov}(X, Y) = 0\\)</span> but not converse</li>\n<li>Covariance matrix: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{ij} = \\mathrm{Cov}(X_i, X_j)\">\\(\\Sigma_{ij} = \\mathrm{Cov}(X_i, X_j)\\)</span></li>\n<li>Covariance is positive semidefinite on real <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^2\">\\(L^2\\)</span>; it is not positive definite because constants have zero variance.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Billingsley, Probability and Measure</li>\n<li>Durrett, Probability: Theory and Examples</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-probability-space","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-probability-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-expectation","status":"resolved","id":"2e4ee9615831113b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-expectation]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measurable-function","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-measurable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-integral","status":"resolved","id":"4884f45058a56aac","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-integral]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measurable-function","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S$ (real-valued measurable-function predicate, see [[58-df-measurable-function]]).","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-expectation","status":"r